stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CachedView
  CachedView --> CheckingSession: History restores the page; hide cached controls
  VerifiedView --> CheckingSession: History restores again; hide cached controls
  PausedView --> CheckingSession: History restores or allowed input resumes verification
  CheckingSession --> CheckingSession: Another restore supersedes the pending verification
  CheckingSession --> CheckingSession: An older response completes; keep cached controls hidden
  CheckingSession --> VerifiedView: Latest verification confirms the same session
  CheckingSession --> SessionEnded: Verification denies access or detects a changed session
  CheckingSession --> PausedView: Latest verification is unavailable or its budget refuses it
  PausedView --> PausedView: Read budget still refuses verification; controls stay inert
  SessionEnded --> [*]: Replace the retired document
  %% never: An older successful or unavailable response releases a newer restore fence.
  %% never: Cached controls become interactive before the latest verification succeeds.
  %% Each persisted pageshow increments restoreGeneration before revalidation.
  %% Each poll captures that generation. Only its current owner can render completion.
  %% Revocation remains terminal even if a denied response belongs to an older request.
